@startuml
!include r4-sequence-style.puml
title FE-12 Evaluate Design and Produce Workshop Recommendation
actor "Member" as Actor
participant "<<view>>\n:DesignPages" as Pages
participant "<<controller>>\n:WorkshopRingDesignController" as Controller
participant "<<service>>\n:WorkshopRingDesignApplicationService" as Service
participant "<<facade>>\n:DesignRuleFacade" as RuleFacade
participant "<<service>>\n:WorkshopRecommendationService" as Recommendation
participant "<<facade>>\n:WorkshopPackageDetailsFacade" as PackageFacade
participant "<<facade>>\n:DesignRequestFacade" as RequestFacade

Actor -> Pages : Open saved design summary
activate Pages
Pages -> Controller : GET/evaluate design
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : load owned design
activate Service
Service -> RuleFacade : evaluate material, shape, stones and engraving
activate RuleFacade
RuleFacade --> Service : difficulty, estimate and warnings
deactivate RuleFacade
Service -> Recommendation : apply server thresholds
activate Recommendation
Recommendation --> Service : package, reason and advisory note
deactivate Recommendation
Service --> Controller : evaluation and recommendation
deactivate Service
Controller --> Pages : result + Recommended link + Explore workshops
deactivate Controller
Pages --> Actor : Display summary and recommendation
alt Member follows workshop recommendation
    Actor -> Pages : Open recommended workshop package
    Pages -> PackageFacade : load package details
    PackageFacade --> Pages : package detail
else Member uses design idea for custom product
    Actor -> Pages : Start design consultation/request
    Pages -> RequestFacade : create request context with saved design
    RequestFacade --> Pages : human review and quote flow
end
deactivate Pages
note over Actor,Pages
More than five stones recommends Silver Clay.
Difficulty above nine recommends Wax Casting with two sessions on different days.
Recommendation is advisory and never hides other workshops.
end note
@enduml
